# Template for scripts/appstore.env, which is gitignored.
#
# You do not normally write this by hand — scripts/appstore-bootstrap.sh generates
# it. Copy this file only if you want to set the values yourself.
#
# Every value here is also readable from the environment, so CI can supply the same
# configuration with secrets instead of a file on disk.

# --- Preferred: App Store Connect API key -----------------------------------
# Create at App Store Connect > Integrations > App Store Connect API.
# An App Manager can create an Individual Key; Team Keys need Admin.
# The .p8 itself is NOT stored here. It must live at
#   ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8
# because that is the only place altool looks for it.
#ASC_KEY_ID="ABCD123456"
#ASC_ISSUER_ID="00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"

# --- Fallback: Apple ID with an app-specific password ------------------------
# Tied to a personal Apple ID, so it stops working when that account leaves the
# team. The password lives in the login keychain, not here.
#ASC_USERNAME="you@princeton.edu"
#ASC_KEYCHAIN_ITEM="AutoSignDisplay-ASC"
